WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.184 --> 00:00:01.608
- Lightning, fire, all of it.

00:00:01.608 --> 00:00:02.519
I want all of it.

00:00:02.519 --> 00:00:03.692
- You wanna have all the powers?

00:00:03.692 --> 00:00:04.319
- I want all of it.

00:00:08.687 --> 00:00:09.987
- I love Sailor Moon.

00:00:09.987 --> 00:00:12.588
- I babysat for years,
and literally every cent

00:00:12.588 --> 00:00:16.233
of that money went to Sailor
Moon gear and paraphernalia.

00:00:16.233 --> 00:00:18.451
- I can't think of any
other show where the entire

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:20.599
cast of superheroes is all women.

00:00:20.599 --> 00:00:22.410
- Teamwork was so
important to Sailor Moon,

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:24.418
but it was teamwork that
was very woman-centered.

00:00:24.418 --> 00:00:26.124
- I would absolutely love to see a Latino

00:00:26.124 --> 00:00:27.878
character added into the canon.

00:00:27.878 --> 00:00:28.757
I'd love to see it now.

00:00:28.757 --> 00:00:30.406
- It would be really
great to see a black girl

00:00:30.406 --> 00:00:33.373
as a Sailor Scout, like yeah, afro puffs

00:00:33.373 --> 00:00:35.335
and stuff, I think that'd
be really cute, actually.

00:00:38.936 --> 00:00:40.364
- What kind of weapon do you want?

00:00:40.364 --> 00:00:42.767
- Really long hair that
I could turn into a whip.

00:00:42.767 --> 00:00:45.229
I kinda wanted to be
wearing like high boots

00:00:45.229 --> 00:00:47.406
that have like a killer
heel that could just like.

00:00:47.406 --> 00:00:47.908
(screeches)

00:00:47.908 --> 00:00:48.744
- A killer heel.

00:00:48.744 --> 00:00:50.685
What kind of super power
have you always wanted?

00:00:50.685 --> 00:00:52.055
- Some sort of power with my hair,

00:00:52.055 --> 00:00:55.785
like if I just had big hair,
I could hold stuff in it,

00:00:55.785 --> 00:00:58.647
I don't know, like a
ball of energy and throw

00:00:58.647 --> 00:00:59.721
it at someone.

00:00:59.721 --> 00:01:00.688
- (laughs) Hold something in your hair.

00:01:00.688 --> 00:01:01.750
- Yeah.

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:03.776
- And what would you say
your weapon would be?

00:01:03.776 --> 00:01:06.534
- You mean like a sword or
something, is that what you mean?

00:01:06.534 --> 00:01:07.335
- It can be whatever you want.

00:01:07.335 --> 00:01:07.904
It can be whatever you want.

00:01:07.904 --> 00:01:08.426
- No.

00:01:08.426 --> 00:01:10.235
- I was thinking a pen, like a pen that--

00:01:10.235 --> 00:01:11.052
- (gasps) The pen is
mightier than the sword.

00:01:11.052 --> 00:01:12.428
- [Neetu] Yeah.

00:01:12.428 --> 00:01:14.100
- I definitely want a scepter.

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:17.595
10 percent flirty, but
like 90 percent bad-ass.

00:01:17.595 --> 00:01:19.348
- [Neetu] Why not 100 percent bad-ass.

00:01:19.348 --> 00:01:22.018
- No, we gotta be real.

00:01:22.018 --> 00:01:24.863
We're recreating me, not the ideal woman.

00:01:24.863 --> 00:01:25.571
(laughs)

00:01:27.399 --> 00:01:28.601
- [Voiceover] Do you
want to close your eyes?

00:01:31.393 --> 00:01:32.316
- Can I look?

00:01:32.316 --> 00:01:32.990
- [Voiceover] Yes.

00:01:33.849 --> 00:01:35.370
- Oh my god.

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:36.624
It's so cute.

00:01:36.624 --> 00:01:37.735
- (screams)

00:01:37.735 --> 00:01:38.815
(laughs)

00:01:38.815 --> 00:01:40.295
- Holy (beeps).

00:01:40.295 --> 00:01:42.832
What a fierce bad-ass bitch.

00:01:42.832 --> 00:01:44.492
- I look like Bat Girl. (laughs)

00:01:44.492 --> 00:01:46.594
- And I like that she
got the two piercings.

00:01:46.594 --> 00:01:48.834
They're one of the characters
that I celebrate the most.

00:01:48.834 --> 00:01:50.704
- She even has my like angry face frown.

00:01:50.704 --> 00:01:52.422
- I've got a star in my hair.

00:01:52.422 --> 00:01:53.954
And I can throw it and kill someone.

00:01:53.954 --> 00:01:57.948
- Pug scepter, yes.

00:01:57.948 --> 00:01:59.438
- If you are out there,
animators, you should get

00:01:59.438 --> 00:02:00.839
on this right now.

00:02:00.839 --> 00:02:02.000
- But I think that would be great

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:04.257
for a little girl to see a superhero

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:07.056
that has afro puffs, just like hers.

00:02:07.056 --> 00:02:10.481
- Looking at myself
painted as a superhero,

00:02:10.481 --> 00:02:13.732
really fulfills a part of my childhood

00:02:13.732 --> 00:02:16.681
that was always a little empty.

00:02:16.681 --> 00:02:18.561
- There's something so cool about seeing

00:02:18.561 --> 00:02:21.394
yourself so perfectly
represented, as like this

00:02:21.394 --> 00:02:23.054
bad-ass superhero that makes me want

00:02:23.054 --> 00:02:24.866
to aspire to like be that.

00:02:24.866 --> 00:02:26.352
- The way she's springing to life.

00:02:26.352 --> 00:02:27.339
She's got these two weapons,

00:02:27.339 --> 00:02:29.318
but also the smile on her face,

00:02:29.318 --> 00:02:31.272
like just because she's
fierce and powerful

00:02:31.272 --> 00:02:34.212
doesn't mean that she's
any less beautiful.

00:02:34.212 --> 00:02:35.825
Celebrating those things, and showing

00:02:35.825 --> 00:02:38.426
that it can be married,
is one of the greatest

00:02:38.426 --> 00:02:39.645
strengths of Sailor Moon.

00:02:39.645 --> 00:02:41.050
In fact it makes them more beautiful,

00:02:41.050 --> 00:02:42.345
the more powerful they are.

